  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0-RC.2: adds a .NET 11 (C# 15 preview) target alongside .NET 10 (C# 14), and introduces optimistic-concurrency conditional appends - IEventStore.TryAppendEventsAsync / TryAppendEventAsync with an expectedVersion, returning ConditionalAppendResult (Conflict carries the expected and actual stream lengths). This is the append-only ledger's compare-and-set primitive: a writer that lost the race is told so and nothing is written. Additive; no breaking changes.",
